flowchart LR
  subgraph Current["CURRENT · observed but incomplete"]
    MSG[WhatsApp PDF] --> UP[Uploader outside repo]
    UP --> STORE[(Supabase Storage: cfe-bills)]
    STORE --> POLL[Local S3 polling script]
    POLL --> PDF[PDF / RPU parsing]
    PDF --> LOOKUP[Contigo credential lookup]
    LOOKUP -->|credential present| CONTIGO[Contigo phone + ADB]
    LOOKUP -->|explicit absent| EXLOCAL[Local parked exception]
    LOOKUP -->|RPC/network failure| SAFE[Stop; no automatic signup]
    CONTIGO --> XMLMAIL[CFDI email]
    XMLMAIL --> INGEST[Canonical ingest RPC]
  end

  subgraph Target["TARGET · not deployed; blocked on verified schema and operations"]
    WA[Authorized WhatsApp uploader] --> PRIVATE[(Private Storage object)]
    PRIVATE --> EVT[Storage event / outbox]
    EVT --> DEDUPE[Idempotency by bucket + key + version]
    DEDUPE --> Q[(Durable harvest queue)]
    Q --> CLAIM[Atomic claim + lease]
    CLAIM --> WORKER[Supervised Mac mini worker]
    WORKER --> FETCH[Fetch exact object version]
    FETCH --> VALIDPDF[Validate PDF + strict RPU + bill facts]
    VALIDPDF --> CRED[Credential lookup with typed outcome]
    CRED -->|matching credential| DEVICE[ADB + Contigo]
    CRED -->|missing / already verified| BIZ[Business exception; operator recovery]
    CRED -->|timeout / auth / 5xx| RETRY[Bounded retry + jitter]
    DEVICE --> CFDI[Validate CFDI identity and period]
    CFDI -->|valid| RPC[Canonical ingest RPC]
    CFDI -->|invalid / mismatch| EX[Exception; preserve source]
    RPC --> VERIFY[Interpret result + canonical read-back]
    VERIFY -->|confirmed| DONE[Mark harvested]
    VERIFY -->|uncertain / transient| RETRY
    RETRY --> Q
    DONE --> AUDIT[(Job state + redacted provenance)]
    BIZ --> AUDIT
    EX --> AUDIT
    AUDIT --> PORTAL[Operator portal]
  end